#: ../../source/docs/modules/generator.rst:3 a8a795de06a44e59832eaff17b7b14f2
msgid "Generator"
msgstr "发电机"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/generator.rst:9 23e6ad2ad5ac427fb442c0a620770eda
msgid "Shows generator information on the MAVProxy graphical console."
msgstr "在 MAVProxy 图形控制台上显示发电机信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/generator.rst:11 c59717eebc3040e8816b18b5a8747c4e
msgid ""
"If an on-board electrical generator is sending ``GENERATOR_STATUS`` MAVLink "
"messages, thse will be display on the console. This includes fields such as "
"RPM, current, voltage, runtime and diagnostic flags."
msgstr ""
"若机载发电机正在发送 ``GENERATOR_STATUS`` MAVLink "
"消息，这些信息将显示在控制台上，包括转速、电流、电压、运行时间和诊断标志等字段。"
